/* Interface identifiers and method order are the published ones, checked against
 * Microsoft's own Windows metadata as published in microsoft/windows-rs
 * (crates/libs/windows/src/Windows/Foundation/Diagnostics). They are not
 * guesses, and the difference is not cosmetic: an invented IID fails
 * QueryInterface silently, and a method list one entry short sends the caller
 * off the end of the vtable and into whatever follows it.
 *
 * Only the subset a title has actually been seen to use is declared here. */

